	; Pinned 2026-09-08 (Species Groups Phase 2 step 4). This section holds
	; PokemonSpriteCategoryTable, a nybble array asserted against
	; NUM_POKEMON_INDEXES, so it grows ~32 bytes over the full species roster.
	; It was already sitting in $05 by first-fit and the bank had 2 bytes free:
	; moving "Pokemon Data 1"/CryData out of here freed 570 bytes and two small
	; floaters ("HUD Pokeball GFX", "Pick Up Item") immediately took them.
	; Pinning it means rgblink reserves its space BEFORE placing floaters, so the
	; growth is guaranteed and the floaters get pushed elsewhere on their own.
	; No code moved for this; the section stays exactly where it already was.
	"ProceduralCaveGen"
