	"Battle Engine 11"
	; Pinned here 2026-08-18 (ShinRed_Tracker.md Phase 1.4), same first-fit
	; reason as the $2E block below. The Yellow audio import freed ~4.3 KB across
	; the three audio banks, and rgblink immediately handed the two largest
	; chunks of it straight back to these floating sections: "Relocated HOME
	; Routines" ($089a) took bank $08 from an expected 2208 free down to 6, and
	; "ProcStageHooks" ($00fd) took bank $02 from 328 down to 75 - byte-exact
	; matches, so the attribution is certain. Both are reached only by farcall
	; and both files' own headers document them as bank-independent leaves, so
	; they run correctly from any bank. Pinned out of the audio banks to keep
	; that reclaimed space available for the Phase 2 audio/SFX work.
	"Relocated HOME Routines"
	"ProcStageHooks"
	"Status View Navigation"
